{"kode":"CRSN","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000004170","email":["corpsec@carsurin.com"],"fax":"","npwp":"01.307.141.0-073.000","phone":"+62 21 5022 6868","website":"www.carsurin.com","key":"","lastupdate":"2023-07-10T02:00:11+07:00","value":"","office":"SOHO CAPITAL, 28th Floor\nJl. Letjen S. Parman Kav.28\nGrogol Petamburan, Jakarta BaratSOHO CAPITAL, 28th Floor\nJl. Letjen S. Parman Kav.28\nGrogol Petamburan, Jakarta Barat\n"}],"background":"PT Carsurin Tbk (“Perseroan”) adalah perusahaan Inspeksi, Pengujian, Sertifikasi dan Verifikasi swasta terkemuka di Indonesia. Perseroan didirikan dengan nama PT Carsurin Limited (dahulu) berdasarkan Akta Pendirian Perseroan Terbatas Perseroan No. 15 tanggal 14 Desember 1968 dan diperbaiki dengan Naskah No. 2 tanggal 2 Desember 1969 yang dibuat dihadapan Than Thong Kie ., Notaris di Kota Jakarta.\n\nAkta Pendirian tersebut selanjutnya telah diubah beberapa kali, yang mana perubahan terakhir adalah Akta Berita Acara Rapat Umum Pemegang Saham Luar Biasa  PT Carsurin  No.1 tanggal 1 Maret 2023, dibuat di hadapan Christina Dwi Utami ., Notaris di Kota Administrasi Jakarta, akta sebagaimana dimaksud telah memperoleh persetujuan Menkumham berdasarkan Surat Keputusan No. AHU-0014199.AH.01.02.TAHUN 2023 tanggal 7 Maret 2023, diberitahukan kepada Menkumham berdasarkan Surat Penerimaan Pemberitahuan Perubahan Anggaran Dasar No. AHU-AH.01.09-0097702  tanggal 6 Maret 2023, terdaftar dalam Daftar Perseroan No. AHU-0046233.AH.01.11.TAHUN 2023 tanggal 6 Maret 2023.\n\nKegiatan usaha yang dijalankan Perseroan saat ini adalah dalam bidang usaha jasa Testing, Certification, Inpection (TIC).\n\nPerseroan memiliki dengan lebih dari 19 kantor cabang (Dumai, Jakarta, Pontianak, Batam, Belitung, Kendari, Medan, Surabaya, Halmahera, Semarang, Berau, Bontang, Cilegon, Palembang, Samarinda, Tanah Merah, Cikarang,Banjarbaru, Jambi, Balikpapan) dan 17 laboratorium serbaguna serta keberadaan internasional yang terus berkembang.\n\nPerseroan menyediakan layanan dan solusi teknis pihak ketiga yang independen untuk berbagai industri: Minerals & Metals, Energy, Product & System Certification, Infrastructure, Digital Transformation, Environment & Sustainability, Food & Agriculture, Marine, Offshore & Insurance. Perusahaan Perseroan memiliki sejarah yang membanggakan dalam memberikan Solusi Berkualitas dengan Integritas selama lebih dari 50 tahun.","history":{"amount":"75 B","board":"Papan Pengembangan","date":"10 Jul 2023","price":"125","registrar":"","shares":"600,000,000","underwriters":["NH Korindo Sekuritas Indonesia"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"20.16%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"17293853","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"TIMOTIUS NUGRAHA TJAHJANA"}],"director":[{"id":"17293850","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"-"},{"id":"17293849","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"DEBASISH MOHAPATRA                "},{"id":"17293848","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"THERESIA IVONNE          "}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"17293852","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"RUTH PANJAITAN"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"17293851","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"SHEILA MARIA TIWAN"}],"president_director":[{"id":"17293847","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2025-11-18T17:08:23+07:00","value":"ERWIN MANURUNG"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"29.48%","name":"FLORA REGINA REGIAN","value":"852.62 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percent